sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as rd-calendar.js
  participant R as rd.js
  participant S as routes_api.py
  U->>C: drop card on a day cell
  C->>C: remember drop (data-day)
  R->>S: PATCH /api/rd (save: column, order)
  S-->>R: ok
  R->>C: flushCalDrop
  C->>S: POST /api/rd/id/schedule {date}
  S->>S: card_schedule.drop_on_day
  alt active nudge would be deferred
    S-->>C: 409
  else bad date
    S-->>C: 400
  else unknown card
    S-->>C: 404
  else ok
    S-->>C: result, cards_changed pushed
  end
